  BITPIX  =                   16 / number of bits per data pixel                  NAXIS   =                    2 / number of data axes                            NAXIS1  =                  171 / length of data axis 1                          NAXIS2  =                  128 / length of data axis 2                          PCOUNT  =                    0 / required keyword; must = 0                     GCOUNT  =                    1 / required keyword; must = 1                     BUNIT   = 'unit    '           / Units of the image                             EXTNAME = 'CCD7_offset_c'      / label                                          END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           